2026-09-23: TODO K01 diagnostic controls. K01 remains OPEN.
These isolate a shared runtime failure; they are not a compiler/kernel fix,
an unchanged sched_ext PASS, or proof of a QEMU/RCU root cause.

Final source SHA-256:
